infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Handwrite the REST adapter, or compile it from the contract
  desc Five endpoints favor the hand; sixty favor the generator
  compares
    - label Handwritten REST adapter
      children
        - label Flexible at ~5 endpoints
          desc Below a handful, hand-rolling wins on freedom of shape
        - label 60 RPCs -> 60 drift risks
          desc Each endpoint is one more chance for docs to diverge from proto
        - label 60 hand-rolled error maps
          desc Every status->HTTP mapping written and maintained by hand
        - label 3 edits per field change
          desc Touch the proto, the adapter, and the docs for one field
    - label Generated gateway
      children
        - label Review lives in the .proto
          desc API review moves into the contract, gated by buf breaking
        - label 60 RPCs -> 1 contract
          desc Annotations compile every endpoint from a single source
        - label 1 error map, owned globally
          desc One runtime.WithErrorHandler owns the whole table
        - label 1 edit per field change
          desc Change the proto; proxy, docs, and OpenAPI follow
theme
  palette #f43f5e #14b8a6
